# =============================================================================
# .copilotignore — Exclude heavy/irrelevant dirs from Copilot context indexing
# Saves tokens by preventing Copilot from reading files that never need AI edits
# =============================================================================

# --- Build artifacts & caches ---
**/__pycache__/
**/node_modules/
**/.dart_tool/
**/build/
**/.firebase/
origna_gta/.dart_tool/
origna_gta/build/

# --- Emulator data (huge binary/JSON dumps) ---
emulator-data/
firebase-export-*/

# --- Logs ---
logs/
*.log
firebase-debug.log*

# --- Test output (stale results, not source code) ---
test-results/
e2e/test_output.txt
e2e/test_results_integration.txt

# --- Audit output (AI reports, not source code) ---
audit/output/
audit/__pycache__/
audit/*.md

# --- Generated docs that are too large for context ---
docs/SYMBOL_MAP.md
docs/diagrams/

# --- Lock files ---
e2e/package-lock.json
origna_gta/pubspec.lock

# --- IDE/OS artifacts ---
.DS_Store
*.pid
*.seed

# --- Large JSON schemas (loaded on-demand via skills, not for indexing) ---
docs/json_schemas/
